  "title": "Three Approaches to the Quantitative Definition of Information",
  "text": "There are two common approaches to the quantitative definition of \"information\": combinatorial and probabilistic. The author briefly describes the major features of these approaches and introduces a new algorithmic approach that uses the theory of recursive functions.",
